+# Implementation Plan: Availability Query
+
+**Spec**: specs/002-availability-query/spec.md
+
+## Technical Context
+TypeScript, no runtime dependency, `node --test`. Single file `src/index.ts`, tests in `test/rental.test.ts`.
+Constitution: unfilled template, no rules to check.
+
+## Design
+- Add `AvailabilityQuery { start, end, kind? }` type and `availability(query): string[]` to `createRentalService`.
+- Validate the period with `parseMidnight` and `end > start`; validate `kind` when not `undefined`.
+- Extract the overlap test used by `book` into a shared helper so both use one rule (SC-001).
+- Filter equipment by kind and absence of overlapping bookings; return ids sorted (default string order) in a new array.
+
+## Artifacts
+No contracts or data model changes (no new entities).
